window.products.push({"id":972056,"name":"Comfty RGB LED Reclining Diamond Quilted Black Leather Racing Gaming Pillows & Remote Control Chairs, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JTS2ofRFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Take your gaming to the next level with COMFTY gaming chairs. This LED gaming chair brightens up your gaming room with beautiful RBG lighting. With a luxurious sportscar designed racing car seat, this computer chair is made with diamond quilted polyurethane bonded leather upholstery and LED lighting around the frame. Remote control allows you to choose from 7 color options and a full brightness, speed and color control. RGB gaming chair comes with headrest and lumbar pillows for added support and comfort. Enjoy the adjustable reclining back for leaning back and taking a break. A multi-functional mechanism is used to lock the back angle position at any angle from 90 to 150 degrees. 2D T-armrests are padded for added support and offer both height and rotate adjustments. Our premium executive chair is upholstered in beautiful and durable polyurethane leather that is wear and water resistant. Extra 3.55” thick high density sponge cushioning also features a waterfall edge seat for improved leg circulation. Features pneumatic seat height adjustment from 17.72”-20.87” H, tilt tension control and back angle adjustment with locking position. Back measures 21.65” W x 33.46” H. Seat measures 20.47” W x 19.69” D. Stable 5-blade swivel caster base includes dual wheel 360-degree swivel casters for 360-degree swivel and mobility. 264 lb. capacity. Measures 26.77” x 22.05” x 49.21”-52.36” H overall. Weighs 42.99 lbs. Meets or exceeds BIFMA standards. Easy assembly. 1 year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JTS2ofRFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Comfty","source_asin":"B09VQ4X9VG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-972056","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VQ4X9VG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VQ4X9VG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
