window.products.push({"id":972067,"name":"DOZZZ Set of 2 Premium Hypoallergenic Stuffer Pillow Insert Sham Square Form Cushion Polyester, 18\" L X 18\" W (Gold)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YQwLKRpfL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Dress Up Your Living Room And Bedroom With Some Elegant Decorative Cushions! Your sofa looks “naked” without a couple of pillows thrown on it, so it’s time to buy inserts for those amazing pillow covers that you love so much! DOZZZ has designed these fluffy and absolutely comfortable pillow inserts in two sizes: 16\" x 16\" and 18\" x 18\". Once you put those beautiful square covers on these cushion inserts, your space will immediately become warmer and more welcoming! The Safest Poly Pillow Inserts On The Market! Our decorative pillow inserts are not only comfortable, but also absolutely safe and healthy for you and your loved ones. The stuffing of the DOZZZ cushion inserts is made with 100% hypoallergenic polyester, so you can have some peace of mind. The outer cover shell of the pillow forms is also made with polyester, making them the comfiest pillows you’ll ever own! You Can Use The Pillow Inserts As Soon As The Arrive At Your House! We ship our decorative pillows inside zippered fiberweb bags, which keep them clean and maintain their perfect square shape. So once you receive your new pillow forms, you don’t have to wash them! You can use them immediately! However, we do recommend you to let them take some air and sun, in order to restore their fluffiness! Purchase The DOZZZ Pillow Inserts With Confidence! Our decorative cushions are under a 30-day money back satisfaction guarantee, so there’s no reason to hold back. If you’re not happy with your purchase, we will refund you – simple as that! Need we say more? Add The Pillow Insert Set To Your Cart NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YQwLKRpfL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOZZZ","source_asin":"B00SLGUDZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-972067","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00SLGUDZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00SLGUDZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
