window.products.push({"id":972112,"name":"Rada Cutlery Stubby Butcher Knife – Stainless Steel Blade With Black Stainelss Steel Resin Handle Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KuExeSLOL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"The Rada Cutlery W206 Stubby Butcher Knife is a versatile kitchen knife that you will find yourself using for a wide variety of kitchen tasks.  The 5-3/8 inch blade is sized so you can use this knife on foods big and small.  It is ideal for cutting ribs, disjointing poultry, slicing a pineapple or large melon and cutting up cakes and pies.  The blade on the butcher knife is made from surgical grade, T420 high carbon stainless steel and hand sharpened creating a razor sharp edge.  The hollow ground blade ensures a precision concave surface for maximum edge retention.  The handle grip is thicker than a traditional butcher knife which will help you control the blade easier.  There is also a finger guard for your safety while using the knife. The handle on the butcher knife is comprised of a black stainless steel resin that can be washed in the dishwasher.  Hand washing fine cutlery is recommended but this handle is dishwasher tolerant.   Rada Mfg. Co. is located in Waverly, Iowa and has been manufacturing cutlery in the USA since 1948.  Our mission is all about “providing our customers the best value of kitchen knives for their dollar.”  We stand by our craftsmanship.  Rada Mfg. Co. will replace any product manufactured by our company returned to us due to defects in material or workmanship.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KuExeSLOL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RADA","source_asin":"B001GUVSIQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-972112","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001GUVSIQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001GUVSIQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
