window.products.push({"id":972213,"name":"3 Quart Non-Stick Enamel Cast Iron Dutch Oven Pot with Lid, Suitable for Bread Baking Use on Gas Electric Oven, as Bread Pan, Soup Pot, Stew Pot, 3 Qt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OmD0UVYVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SUITABLE FOR 2-3 PEOPLE】 3 Quart Enameled Dutch Oven is the perfect vessel to cook foods and desserts. Its flawless design makes your food looks more delicious. The rainbow colors create a beautiful tablescape for any occasion. Perfect choice for a family of three. 【EXTRA-EVEN HEAT DISTRIBUTION】 The dutch oven cast iron has heavy cast iron construction, thick walls, and a heavy lid to create a steamy environment while stewing and keep food warmer for longer. The self-basting spikes of the lid collect and return all moisture back into the dish - nothing dries out and the food stays moist. So it can bring out the best flavor and conserve nutrition. High temperature is usually unnecessary for the energy-saving pot. 【EASY TO CLEAN & NO ODORS】 Non-stick dutch ovens pot comprises a classic blue enameled exterior and a matte white enameled interior; ideal for browning meat; great for healthy cooking without safety worries;easy-to-clean; no retained flavors of food. The non-porous surface does not give out flavors nor does it absorb odors or moist, and is slick enough to be nonstick without any maintenance. Most messes just need a gentle soak and scrub to wipe away. Our dutch oven is also dishwasher-safe! 【VERSATILE USAGE】 Usable on gas, electric, ceramic, and induction stovetops, in an oven, or even on a grill, it's perfect for cooking, roasting, frying, or baking your favorite dishes. Oven safe 500℉. 【STYLISH GIFT】 Useful dutch oven pot in a variety of different and vibrant colors makes your kitchen surroundings lovely and appealing. Artisan enameled cast iron, colorful and beautiful cookware for every kitchen. Best gift for men and women for Halloween, Thanksgiving, New Year's Day, Christmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OmD0UVYVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOBRILLFUN","source_asin":"B0922FNLTL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-972213","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0922FNLTL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0922FNLTL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
