window.products.push({"id":972330,"name":"Bride to Be Bachelorette Party Decorations - Rose Gold Bridal Shower Decor with Bride to Be Sash, Foil Balloon Backdrop, Latex Balloons, Bunting Banne","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yRF3iBN9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Salute her in style Mordesso Bride to Be Decorations in shimmering rose gold set an elegant tone for her bachelorette party. Complete with bachelorette party games, balloons, satin sash and tattoos, it creates a memorable bridal shower backdrop for photos and fun. Printable PDFs for 5 laughter-inducing games ensure that everyone can join in on the festivities. Easy to set up and take down, our Bachelorette Party Kit is ideal for celebrating at home or slipping away to Vegas. Make it a day to remember Festoon the party venue with 16\" tall foil balloons that form a Bride to Be banner where she can rein over the festivities from her seat of honor. A triangle bunting banner is perfect for adorning a doorway, and foil balloons shaped like hearts and a diamond ring are ideal for the cake and gift tables. Also included are 10 rose gold latex balloons, 10 pearl white latex balloons, and 6 confetti latex balloons. Two inflator straws, a plastic threading needle, 10 meters of silver balloon ribbon and a 5-meter string allow easy hanging of our bridal shower balloons and banners. Ensure she's the center of attention A luxurious double-layer satin Bride to Be sash leaves no doubt to onlookers that she is about to take that big walk down the aisle. With a sheet of bachelorette tattoos that she and her bridesmaids can adorn themselves with, this is a day that will long be remembered for its cheeky innuendo and heartfelt toasts shared with her closest girlfriends. Send her off to Holy Matrimony in grand fashion. Add Mordesso Bride to Be Decorations to your bachelorette party supplies today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yRF3iBN9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mordesso","source_asin":"B08S6V1M4L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-972330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S6V1M4L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S6V1M4L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
