window.products.push({"id":972496,"name":"THREAD SPREAD 5 Star Luxury Sheets Full Size 100% Cotton - Egyptian Cotton Quality 600 Thread Count Full Sheet Set - 4 Piece Burgundy Bed Sheets with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71znpxBk8DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ 100% COTTON SHEETS THAT ARE SUPER SMOOTH & SILKY: Treat your home to a 5 Star Hotel Experience with our PREMIUM 600 HIGH THREAD COUNT sheet set. Made from 100% extra long-staple cotton and a lustrous sateen finish, our full size sheet set is buttery smooth, thick, and crisp for a heavenly feeling. These Egyptian cotton quality sheets are breathable to keep you cool in the summer and cozy during winters for ultimate comfort all year-around ✔ EXTRA DEEP POCKETS WITH ELASTIC FOR A SNUG FIT: Toss and turn in the night and the fitted sheet won’t come off. Our pillowcases fit over the pillows perfectly and the cotton bed sheets full size fit adjustable mattresses up to 17 inches deep. The smart tags tell you which side the cotton bed sheets go so you can make the bed easily. Our 4 piece full sheet set includes a flat sheet (81” W x 96” L), a fitted sheet (54” W x 75” L + 15 inch deep pocket), and two pillow cases (20” W x 30” L) ✔ EASY TO WASH, CARE & MAINTAIN: Each sheet set is independently tested for anti-pilling, shrink-resistance, and fade-resistance. We recommend washing our burgundy cotton sheets in warm water and tumble drying on low mode. The fabric opens up and softens with every wash, leaving the sheets smoother and silkier. To avoid wrinkles, immediately remove the linens from the dryer and fold them ✔ CERTIFIED & MORE DURABLE THAN OTHER SHEETS: Our cotton sheets full size set is certified as STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX® to ensure no harmful chemicals make into your bedding. These 100% cotton sheets are more durable, natural, and eco-friendly, compared to microfiber sheets that attract dust and static and can be unhealthy for you and the environment ✔ YOUR SATISFACTION IS OUR PRIORITY #1: We’re confident you will love our cotton bed sheets. But in case you have an issue, reach out to us and we will make up to you. We can issue a replacement or refund—whatever you like. Our full sheet set are also a great gift for your loved ones on festive seasons such asMother’s Day, Father’s Day, Women’s Day, Men’s Day, Christmas, Valentine’s Day, Halloween, Weddings, Vacations, and Autumn Holidays","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71znpxBk8DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THREAD SPREAD","source_asin":"B01HUUWVUE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-972496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HUUWVUE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HUUWVUE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
