window.products.push({"id":972635,"name":"SignMission Houston Wall World time Zone Clock Office Business, Beagle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.74,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Uy588GpbL._AC_.jpg","description":"Get a fun Wall Clock for your home and office and show off your sense of style. Looking for a fun, hilarious clock to hang on your cubicle or in your &; man cave? If so, SignMission has all the cute, funny, hilarious, and even work-related novelty clocks you're looking for! Something for Everyone We've got a wide range of American-made clocks just like this one that will tickle your funny bone, make others smile, or even show off your snarky attitude. Product Details: This wall clock measures 10 inches in diameter. It has a black plastic frame with a clear cover. The graphics are rich and vibrant and will last a lifetime. The clock has precision quartz movement and operates on 1 AA battery (not included). These clocks make a great accent to any room in your home or business. A perfect addition to your kitchen, bathroom, bedroom, family room or anywhere.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Uy588GpbL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SignMission","source_asin":"B01D3DZFS2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-972635","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01D3DZFS2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01D3DZFS2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":972636,"name":"Sturdis Shoe Storage Bench Antique Blue - Cushion Seat - Adjustable Shelves - Soft-Close Hinges - for Comfort & Style, Perfect for Entryway First Impr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81to+E5BT4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ELEGANT ENTRYWAY SHOE STORAGE BENCH: Create a tidy and welcoming entrance with our shoe bench organizer. This classic, yet modern style shoe storage bench with shutter doors is a must have for any front entryway. Built from sturdy materials, the mudroom bench ensures that your space is tidy with your shoes hidden away. COMFORTABLE CUSHION ENTRY BENCH SEAT: Take a seat and put on your favourite shoes. The bench cushion is firm but comfortable to sit on and comes with a removable cover that can be washed. The best way to start and end the day is with this classic yet modern shoe bench for your home. MULTIPURPOSE STORAGE SOLUTIONS: This versatile storage bench with seating can be just as useful as a window bench, boot storage or used as a storage bench for bedroom. With its removable and adjustable shelves for multi-uses, this storage bench blends easily in any room of the house. Remove or adjust the shelves to provide space for a variety of options. Use this bench with storage to read your favourite books then store them away inside when done - the possibilities are many. DESIGN WITH SAFETY IN MIND: With a seating load capacity of up to 330lbs, this antique blue shoe bench is designed with sturdiness in mind. The shoe storage cabinet door hinges are soft-close to add further quality, safety and durability. DIMENSION: Length 35.83\" x Width 13.78\" x Height 18.5\" ; Weight: 41lbs. Fits 10 -12 pair of woman shoes sizes. ASSEMBLY REQUIRED.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81to+E5BT4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sturdis","source_asin":"B0BZHT7D75","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-972636","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZHT7D75","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZHT7D75","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
