window.products.push({"id":972647,"name":"TRIFO Robot Vacuum Cleaner, Robot Cleaner 4000Pa, Objects Avoidance, Visual SLAM Navigation, 1080P Camera Home Surveillance, AI Mapping, Self-Charging","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":329.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rmVP1TKKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【4000Pa Strong Suction】The powerful 4000Pa suction makes clean-up easier for this robot vacuum. Vacuum up crumbs, dust, and any debris from carpet fibers all in a single pass. A six-sided claw brush ensures that no mess will be left behind. 【120min Long Runtime】Trifo Ollie vacuums up to 120min on a single charge with a 5200mAh battery, and can easily clean up to 2000 square feet. Trifo Ollie has a large 600ml dustbin, holding more debris and pet hair. 【3D SLAM Navigation】Trifo's patented visual SLAM technology enables Ollie robot vacuum to take precise measurements and maximize cleaning coverage. Ollie learns and adapts to the surroundings, adjusts the cleaning path automatically, and creates an efficient cleaning route. 【 Binocular Vision Navigation for Obstacle Avoidance】Thanks to Ollie's precise ToF depth sensor for obstacle avoidance - it can identify objects almost down to 1-inch height, whereas most robot vacuums can only detect objects down to 4-inch height. With a 1080 HD color camera, Ollie spots movement and offers you a real-time view of your home both day and night. 【AI dToF Sensor】Artificial Intelligence (AI) and exceptional depth Time-of-Flight (ToF) sensors help Ollie map out your house and clean 3.3 times faster compared to regular robot vacuums. With Trifo's over-the-air (OTA) updates and every vacuum run, Ollie picks up quickly on its surroundings and makes cleaning decisions faster and better. 【 Pet-Friendly Design】Trifo Ollie robot vacuum comes with our pet Fun Toy that allows you to play with your pets while keeping the cleaning. Ollie helps you fight odors while vacuuming. With a small pet toy, you can keep your pet entertained while Ollie cleans up! With Ollie's 1080P HDR camera, you can easily listen, talk, and record your furry friends whenever and wherever! 【Smart AI Mapping】Featuring exceptional AI learning, Ollie can map out 3.3X more efficiently than ordinary robot vacuums. Ollie recognizes and divides rooms automatically, and you can name the rooms by yourself, i.e. \"living room\", \"kitchen\", etc. Keep certain areas quiet by setting up No-Go zones by selecting No-Go zones on your floorplan map. 【Trifo Home App & Voice Control】Ollie robot vacuum can be paired with Alexa or Google Home and can start & stop cleaning at your voice commands. You can also launch Ollie robotic vacuum cleaner using the Trifo Home App. In the Trifo Home App, you can monitor real-time cleaning, pet camera, battery power, accessories status, customize cleaning modes, schedule cleaning, and use manual control. 【Focus on Customer Experience】At Trifo, we value all our customers and their experiences. We are constantly improving and can't wait to implement your suggestions in our next updates! 【Trifo's Vision】Imagine a future with specifically designed robots to take care of your home, so you can live better and focus on what's more important. That's our vision when we created Trifo in 2016. Trifo is a full-stack AI home robot company that offers people a balance between family, work, and personal life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rmVP1TKKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trifo","source_asin":"B0BYNW4WL7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-972647","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYNW4WL7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYNW4WL7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
