window.products.push({"id":972781,"name":"Kitchen Sliding Cabinet Organizer,Pull Out Chrome Wire Storage Basket Drawer for Kitchen Cabinets Cupboards,10.4\" 17.3\" 5.3\" (WxLxH) fits Inside 13.8\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61n3QNAWWAL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"MATERIAL: Our Wire Baskets are made of chromed stainless steel£¬Non-toxic, heat resisting and not easily deformed. The highest quality steel and chrome finish gives you unparalleled strength and durability for long time trouble-free use. DIFFERENT SIZES TO FIT ALL YOUR CABINETS: We make a full selection of pull out organizers in various widths and you can choose the one that fit your cabinet:1. 10.4\"*17.3\"*5.3\" fits inside 13.8\" width cabinet ; 2. 12.4\"*17.3\"*5.3\" fits inside 15.7\" width cabinet ; 3. 16.4\"*17.3\"*5.3\" fits inside 19.7\" cabinet width ; 4. 20.3\"*17.3\"*5.3\" fits inside 23.6\" cabinet width. LARGE BEARING CAPACITY: The maximum load is up to 20KG.It can contain different kinds of tableware and allows you to easily get at things at the back of your kitchen cupboards. Easy Installation: Our Storage Basket come with a pair of full extension ball bearing runners enabling the basket to be pulled out of the cabinet smoothly and the added benefit of having soft close runners ensuring gentle, safe closing every time. Assembly material included and you can install it in minutes.Please install it at the middle of your cabinet intstead of the bottom. APPLICATION: Our Cabinet Organizers offers different selection of pull out cabinet organizers to transform the cabinet in your kitchen, pantry, bathroom, and laundry room to the beauty and convenience of our slide out organizers. It's great for all cabinets, under sink storage and as a rack for pots and pans.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61n3QNAWWAL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Estink","source_asin":"B01M9CXT6G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-972781","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M9CXT6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M9CXT6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
