window.products.push({"id":972783,"name":"Eufy Vacuum Replacement Parts Compatible with Eufy Robovac 11+, Eufy 11 Plus Vacuum Cleaner Accessories - Filters and Side Brushes (Pack of 12)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6132zLmgXwL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Compatibility - Fit for Eufy 11+ ONLY. Package including - 6 filter, 6 side brushes. High Performance - Snap into place for quick and effortless replacement. No tools required,easy to replace the filters. Maintenance - Keep your Robot running at peak performance by changing the the consumable replenishment kit every 2~3 months,depending on your use frequency. Manufacture Guarantee - The replacement comes with 60 days warranty.Respond within 24 hours if you have any questions about the replacements.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6132zLmgXwL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BBT BAMBOOST","source_asin":"B0794WFDXG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-972783","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0794WFDXG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0794WFDXG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
