window.products.push({"id":972785,"name":"EAIMi Indoor Chair Cushions for Dinning Chairs 4 Packs| Tufted Memory Foam Overstuffed Kitchen Chair Pads with Ties | Textured Non Slip Back Seat Cush","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vK1lWzQHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Comfortable & Durable - This set of chair cushions for dining chairs consists of four individual products, each one filled with a high-quality shredded sponge that provides exceptional elasticity and comfort. The cushions are designed to fit a variety of indoor chairs and measure 15.5 by 15.5 inches in size. Whether you're working from home, relaxing in your living room, or enjoying a meal at your dining table, these cushions will provide the comfort and support you need. Non-Slip & Stability - This chair pad for dining chairs is designed with non-slip fabric on the back, making it ideal for indoor use. The anti-skid material ensures that the cushion stays securely in place on your chair, providing maximum comfort and stability. Its durable construction and soft texture make it a perfect addition to any home or office space. Whether you're using it for a long day at work or a cozy evening at home, this cushion is sure to provide the support and comfort you need. Versatile & Adaptable - The shape of the kitchen bench cushions is designed to fit a variety of chair styles. Its versatile form allows it to conform to different seating surfaces, providing both comfort and support. Whether used on a dining chair, armchair, or even a stool, the cushion's shape remains accommodating and adaptable. With its universal design, the seat cushion can enhance the functionality and aesthetic appeal of any seating arrangement. Resilient & Fluffy - The seat cushion may appear flattened upon initial opening due to vacuum packaging. However, it will eventually bounce back to its original shape as the material is resilient and adaptive, providing optimal support and comfort. Fluff and adjust as needed for desired firmness. With proper care, it will retain its shape and performance for extended use. Easy Care & Customer Guarantee - The dining chair cushions are easy to clean and maintain, with durable material that allows for effortless wipe-down of spills, stains, and dirt. Our commitment to excellent customer service ensures that we're available to answer any questions or concerns and assist with any product-related issues. With our reliable customer support and the cushion's effortless cleaning capabilities, customers can enjoy a worry-free seating experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vK1lWzQHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EAIMi","source_asin":"B0BXNMXBKQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-972785","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXNMXBKQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXNMXBKQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":972786,"name":"MIU France Bamboo Cutting Board, 6.5\" x 6.5\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41KHNR84CQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Measuring 6-1/2 by 6-1/2 by 1-1/4 inches, this conveniently sized bamboo chopping block is great for heavy cuts of meat or vegetables. Made from bamboo, the board has a distinctive appearance due to bamboo's natural sugars caramelizing and creating a medley of beautiful browns. This premium select grade of bamboo is 18-percent harder than rock maple, making it a superior material for cutting boards and home products. The chopping board is handcrafted using small flattened bamboo strips glued and pressed together with approved food-grade glue. No paints or stains are used. The board is easy to wash off with soap and water, and the occasional coat of mineral oil will keep it looking new.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41KHNR84CQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIU France","source_asin":"B0009VEOBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-972786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0009VEOBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0009VEOBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":972787,"name":"Peru Pima - Wrinkle Resistant - 250 Thread Count Percale - Peruvian Pima Cotton - King Bed Sheet Set, Slate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91iSnKi-R0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Peru Pima - Wrinkle Resistant - 250 Thread Count Percale - Peruvian Pima Cotton - King Bed Sheet Set, Slate","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91iSnKi-R0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peru Pima","source_asin":"B07HKRKDWN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-972787","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HKRKDWN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HKRKDWN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":972788,"name":"KoMo PK1 - Grain Mill","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ThgJb5FvL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"With its unique hexagonal cabinet, the Austrian-made KoMo PK 1 is the perfect centerpiece of a healthy diet and lifestyle. The internal workings of the PK 1 are identical to the Classic mill, with large 3.35 inch diameter, self sharpening corundum-ceramic burrs and high efficiency 360 watt motor. Its exterior is beautifully crafted entirely of solid beechwood. All KoMo mills are equipped with specially developed electric motors that are highly reliable and efficient, yet extremely quiet. The PK 1's 360 watt motor enables it to produce 8-9 ounces per minute for bread flour texture. Its solid beech hopper holds 2 lb., 4 oz. of grain. The PK1 will grind a wide array of grains including soft or hard wheat, oat groats, rice, triticale, kamut, spelt, buckwheat, barley, rye, millet, teff, quinoa, amaranth, sorghum and dent corn. It will also grind lentils, dry beans (pinto, red, garbanzo/chickpeas, kidney & more), and dried, non-oily spices. It isn't suitable for herbs, oilseeds like flax or sesame, popcorn, or fibrous materials. Dent (field) corn and soybeans can be ground to any texture from cracked to meal to very fine flour. For these very large-kerneled grains, grind first with the stones opened widely to produce cracked grain, then a second time if you want flour. The KoMo PK 1 will grind oats to a wonderfully soft, fine textured flour, but open the stones about five clicks (or so) wider than you would for a hard grain like wheat, otherwise the soft oat flour will fill the stones' furrows and in-feeding will stop. Opening the stones further will give you a cereal grind for porridge, or coarser yet for cracked oats, similar to steel-cut. The grind of the PK 1 Mill is continuously adjustable from fine flour to coarse meal and cracked grain, just by turning the hopper bowl. Access to the milling chamber takes just a moment and requires no tools.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ThgJb5FvL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KoMo Mills","source_asin":"B004YTQHAU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-972788","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004YTQHAU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004YTQHAU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
