window.products.push({"id":972865,"name":"TAMUME Golden Crystal-Clear Glass Teapot Warmer for Teapot (400-1200ml) - Large (Golden)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n0G4KoCSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Specification: Material: heat-resistant borosilicate glass. Dimensions: Height 52mm; Ø 105mm (inner rim); Ø 130mm (outer rim); Which Size of Teapot Fits This Teapot Warmer Well? This warmer normally holds teapots with a base diameter within 4.1\"\"(105mm). Larger than that, your teapot won’t sit in the lower recessed area (visible in the product image).  However, you could still put a teapot that has a base diameter up to 5.1\"\"(130mm) on the outer rim , or even larger, the teapot warmer can hold it at a balanced and stable situation. How About the Temperature? If you are unfamiliar with teapot warmers that use a tea light, you can expect your tea to stay at a perfectly drinkable temperature. It won't get past drinkably-hot, and it doesn't let your tea go cold as long as the tea light is still burning. Notes: Keep in mind that you should never keep the teapot on a warmer if it is empty, or you risk damaging your teapot. NOW, IT IS THE TIME! We brew up a pot of tea, light the tea light, and then place the pot on the warmer. The small candle provides just the right amount of heat, keeping the brewed tea at just the right temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n0G4KoCSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAMUME","source_asin":"B071CVS3HQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-972865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071CVS3HQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071CVS3HQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
