window.products.push({"id":972885,"name":"sykting Decorative Pillow Covers Solid Super Soft Short Plush Fuzzy Throw Pillow Covers for Bed Couch Chair Pack of 2 Square 18x18 inch Navy Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SpYYbX2aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sykting Square Pillow Covers Soft Soild Decorative Cushion Cases Short Plush Throw Pillow Shams for Sofa Bed Car Both Sides Product details: Craftsmanship: Use color coordinated hidden zipper closure for an elegant look.Tight zigzag over-lock stitches to avoid fraying and ripping.Material:High quality Short Plush;smooth and super soft;No Fur Shedding;No PillingAll-Season Use:It's breathable and cozy making it the ideal choice for year-round comfort.Machine washable: Wash on cold,gentle cycle,and dry on low. Do not iron.Contain:2 PCs Cushion Cover/Shell,No Insert or FillerWide Applications:bed,chair,sofa,couch,bench,floor,bay window,office,car,party,wedding,outdoor.Also can be used as gift.. Size: *Cover Size 12\" X 20\",Suggest Rectangular Pillow Stuff Size 12\" X 20\"* Cover Size 16\" X 16\",Suggest Square Pillow Stuff Size 16\" X 16\" or 18\" X 18\"* Cover Size 18\" X 18\",Suggest Square Pillow Stuff Size 18\" X 18\" or 20\" X 20\"* Cover Size 20\" X 20\",Suggest Square Pillow Stuff Size 20\" X 20\" or 22\" X 22\" Features: 1.Durable short plush pillowcases,the fabric is super soft,high quality,breathable environmental protection.2.The zipper becomes \"invisible\" when closing,it glides smoothly and allows easy insertion and removal of pillow inserts.3.Simple,modern design makes the pillow a perfect match in any room.With a special creative design,the cushion cover is sure to add vigour,warmth,texture and depth to your home or car. Tips: 1.All cushions are handmade,so please understand there may be 1-2cm deviation exist.2.Due to the lighting and monitors,the actual item's color maybe slighty different from the picture.3.We recommend to put some salt into the water for the first time hand washing,which can help to keep the item colour fresh.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SpYYbX2aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"sykting","source_asin":"B07R8L8637","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-972885","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R8L8637","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R8L8637","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
