window.products.push({"id":972887,"name":"Portable Air Conditioners - 90°Oscillating Personal Air Conditioner with 4 Speeds, Portable AC Cooler with LED Light, 2 Spray Humidity, 2/4/6H Timer, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714KiIPO8IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️4-Wind Speed & 2 Spray Modes - This air conditioner portable has 4 adjustable wind speeds and 2 spray modes, you can customize your own comfortable style according to your needs. What's even better is that its air outlet is a shutter design, which can easily adjust the angle of the wind by turning the blades manually, allowing you to feel cool in many ways in summer and let the cold air spread more widely. ❄️Quiet Cooling& 7 Colors Light - The Air Cooler has LED night light function, which creates a romantic atmosphere when used at night. In the operating mode with the lowest wind speed, the sound of the device is less than 30 decibels. Makes you feel better and sleep better. 2-4-6 hour timer function, lets you enjoy cool sleep on hot summer nights and save more electrical energy ❄️90° Widespread Oscillation Cooler - Our evaporative air cooler is capable of circulating cool air around a wider surface area thanks to the wide-angle oscillation technology. Just press on the “Oscillation” button allows the air cooler fan to oscillate horizontally for 90 degrees, sweeping more areas in the room with a smooth breeze for effective cooling. Choose between the 4 wind settings of low, medium, high or higher ❄️650ML Large Capacity Water Tank - The mini air conditioner has a 650ml (22.87oz)large capacity water tank for long operation for 6-8 hours on spray mode, avoiding frequent water refills. And automatically switch to the natural wind when the water runs out, so you don't have to worry about falling asleep. The top water tank design easy to add water and ice. There is a leak-proof water storage tank at the bottom, which can effectively prevent water from flowing into the desktop. ❄️Ideal Gift for Your Lover - This multi-functional portable ac fan is very energy-saving and environmentally friendly. USB port provides multiple power sources with handles, 90° rotation and a filtration system for air circulation to bring fresh and cool air. Is an ideal gift for your family, parents and friends, especially friends who are afraid of summer hot, and provides 2 years warranty. Only LS-US supports after-sales service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714KiIPO8IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KEERCIGA","source_asin":"B0C7GG6V8M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-972887","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7GG6V8M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7GG6V8M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
