window.products.push({"id":972925,"name":"[12Pcs/Set] PVC Adhesive Nails Wall Hooks Heavy Duty Stick on Door Nail Free Screw Non-Trace No Drilling Nail Self Waterproof Adhesive Hanging Nails H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hzkcBBJbL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Say goodbye to these problems, e. g. No tools! Leave holes in the walls! Destroy the wall! Too much trouble Transparent No Traces Stickers are ideal and smart solutions for fixed storage. Our creative superglue screws are dedicated to serving a better life. No Traces Stickers will not damage the surface of the object, let the object live in harmony. NAIL-FREE, IMPACT-FREE, EASY and COMFORTABLE to install is the greatest advantage of our product. Other advantages are its durability, strong bearing capacity, moisture resistance and water resistance. And the clear adhesive is completely covered by the bracket so that the result is visually perfect. This is also not a problem, just peel it off with the spatula This makes DIY really easy! Dimensions: Wall Hooks From Color: Transparent Gross Weight: 88g Material: Stainless steel+PVC+ABS+glue Stickers nail size: 5cm8cm (LengthWidth) . Screw rod Length: 6, 10, 16mm. Packing Specifications: 6/10/12 Pcs/Set Package included: 6/10/16 No trace stickers nail; 6/10/12Screw nut. Installation steps are as follows:   1. Clean the surface (The surface should be smooth and sufficient, it would also have to deal with a few unevenness in the tiles. The more smooth the wall, the better the results.) 2. Do not touch the adhesive surface so that the adhesive strength is not lost. 3. Tear off the transparent film, Position the position of sticking film and Press and paste the patch firmly for 5 seconds to the wall horizontally. 4. Flatten with force to the patch from inside to outside, press each region tightly to evacuate the air in the sticking patch. 5. Then install hanging rack and screw nut. 6. Check that the installation is against the wall. Notice:   Please ONLY use on clean and dry surfaces, e. g. Wood, Tile, Glass, Wallpaper, Marble, Stainless Steel. The GH ADHESIVE SCREW does not adh","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hzkcBBJbL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Snow Abonci","source_asin":"B08SGS6YSZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-972925","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SGS6YSZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SGS6YSZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
